// the 47E pass and the twitch after 4; the cut to row 47 and the FLUSH after 5; the tail and the vein after 6; the handle and the door after 7; the WHOOSH and the wing after 8;
// the purple, the corks, the kettle and the pilot stepping out after 10; the hat and the cockpit after 11; the pop after 12
